<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Palm Beach County, Fla., agency.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Palm Beach County, Fla., agency.</headline>
<text>
<p>THE SOLID WASTE AUTHORITY OF PALM BEACH COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $300,475,000</p>
<p>Effective at 11:45 A.M. E.S.T., Thursday, March 20, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
